ic risk factor for vascular disease: a common mutation in methylenetetrahydrofolate reductase</article-title><source>Nat Genet</source><year>1995</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>111</fpage><lpage>113</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Nat Genet||10|111||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7647779</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Goto</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Iida</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Cho</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Oka</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kohno</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kondo</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Overexpression of glutathione S-transferase pi enhances the adduct formation of cisplatin with glutathione in human cancer cells</article-title><source>Free Radic Res</source><year>1999</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>549</fpage><lpage>558</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Free Radic Res||31|549||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10630679</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Horie</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Aiba</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Oguro</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hojo</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Takeishi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Functional analysis and DNA polymorphism of the tandemly repeated sequences in the 5&#x02032;-terminal regulatory region of the human gene for thymidylate synthase</article-title><source>Cell Struct Funct</source><year>1995</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>191</fpage><lpage>197</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cell Struct Funct||20|191||bib13|'--><pub